docs/operations/README.md:5:Use Java 21, Maven 3.9.11, Docker Compose, and `bash scripts/setup.sh`. The setup creates an ignored mode-0600 `.env` when needed, applies database schema changes, and starts the app, PostgreSQL 16, and the OpenTelemetry Collector. Credentials are generated from `.env.example` inputs; do not commit `.env`. The app binds to loopback by default and fails closed on blank/placeholder credentials. Database bootstrap, migration owner, and restricted runtime roles remain separate.
